Third-party data

The analysis reads the Broad Drug Repurposing Hub (release 2020-03-24), the GEO
series matrices and the LINCS L1000 release. None of these is redistributed with
this repository: the Hub is provided for non-commercial use only and is obtained
separately (see data/README.md), and the GEO and LINCS inputs are downloaded from
their public sources. Cite the Hub as: Corsello SM, et al. Nature Medicine
2017;23(4):405-408. doi:10.1038/nm.4306
